<!--
    Everything Aangan says, in English. To translate, copy this file to values-XX/strings.xml (XX is
    the language code, such as hi for Hindi) and translate each string, keeping the placeholders
    (%1$s, %2$d) and the quoted spacing as they are. Festival names are translated separately, in
    assets/festival-names/XX.csv. See CONTRIBUTING.md.
-->
